+- Draft meaning: deterministic local rules extract a tentative change intent, literal place/category clues and a short editable reason. This is not generative AI comprehension. Candidates are original objects from the current immutable native saved-place snapshot. A category is matched only by literal words in stored names, never invented metadata, inferred proximity, POI IDs or coordinates. Ambiguous/negative/unsupported language or no match prompts correction or manual selection. General categories include cafes, restaurants and fuel, not rest areas only.
