+
+Product source is frozen at `105cd7ef5b47e194be1fbfd2271ba6d96c0fd32f`, base `8b6321276f33923f24f15a8437205b6126bf92ca`. This directory is an evidence-only closeout, not a product fix or a PASS for a subsequent evidence commit. PR #26 remains Draft; issue #25 remains open and blocked. No merge was attempted.
+
+The user supplied the included timeout screenshot. The associated earlier freeze6 human attempt reached ready/listening, then timed out without a final result. It is a failed recognition observation, not a success. Freeze7 changes microphone ownership to foreground app AudioRecord, keeps bounded PCM in memory, and submits it to the vehicle-local Pleos ON_DEVICE service. User permission for Mac input and Android microphone while using the app was explicitly granted in chat. Android permission was actually granted on B through its OS UI; A's app permission remains ungranted.
